<title>HONG KONG: China Everbright-IHD finalises asset buys.</title>
<headline>China Everbright-IHD finalises asset buys.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd said on Friday it has finalised the purchase of a 20 percent stake in International Bank of Asia Ltd and a 2.5 percent stake in National Mutual Asia Ltd from its parent.</p>
</text>
